	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Salutem et conscientię pacem per Christum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Cum nuper ad colloquium me pręfectus<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Landvogt im <placeName ref="l774">Thurgau</placeName> war zu jener Zeit <persName ref="p1041">Hans Edlibach</persName>, s. oben <ref target="file10147">[Nr. 117]</ref> S. 170, Anm. 3.</note> admisisset, accidit, ut dum <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ultro citroque<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Vgl. Adagia, 1,3,84 (<bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 142 F-143 A); <bibl source="b473">Otto</bibl> 354, Nr. 1814.</note> familiarius quędam inter nos iactarentur, in tui quoque mentionem <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>inciderimus.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Ibi post multa dixit ille congressum tuum non mediocriter <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>se iam pridem expetivisse, sed nescio quo genio deterritum fuisse hactenus.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Tum ego: «Atqui nihil est, quod te prohiberi a <persName ref="p495">Bullingeri</persName> colloquio debeat <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>amplius, si cupis.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Facilem et paratum quovis cum loco tum tempore scio <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>illum se tibi prębiturum esse».</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">- «Non dubito», inquit, «sed nolo impudenter <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>illi me ingerere, si desit iusta occasio».</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">- Quod cum ille serio prę se ferret, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>non abs re facturum esse putavi me, si te huius rei submonerem clanculum, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ita ut quam primum audires illum <placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> esse, non expectando illius occasionem, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quam forsan observat, quemadmodum lunam Accessęus<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Die Redensart gilt Zauderern, die immer glauben, die günstigste Gelegenheit abwarten zu müssen, s. <bibl source="b56">Adagia</bibl>, 1,5,85 (<bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 214 D).</note> ille, qui locum fecit adagio, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>prior hominem compellares atque quomodocumque iniecto sermone de singulis <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>paulatim rebus ad negotium evangelicum pertinentibus exacte cum illo colloquereris, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>constanter tamen interim dissimulando me instigatore hoc fieri.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Protinus ille, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>qua est facilitate dicam an imprudentia nescio, sese tibi aperiet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Hęc in pręsentia <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ad te pro nostra veteri consuetudine, qua mihi quidvis erga te licere puto, scribe<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>re placuit.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Quod superest, facile tabellio<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Unbekannt.</note> referet, a quo etiam causam audies, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>cur literas tuas<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Nicht erhalten.</note> pręfecto reddi noluerimus<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Die Zusammenhänge sind nicht bekannt.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><pb type="edition" next="282"/>Vale, ac nos, ut hactenus <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>fecisti, amice semper complectere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l159">Frowenfeldię</placeName>, idibus decembris anno 1532.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/><persName ref="p8320">Petrus Dasypodius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Domino <persName ref="p495">Henrico Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>vigilantissimo <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinorum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiastę, amico suo <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>non vulgari.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>